WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.500
Hello, my name is Giovanni Russo.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.600
I was a football coach for many years.

3
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:10.400
Because of a herniated disc, I suffered from severe back pain for years.

4
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:14.900
I tried a lot of treatments, like injections and treatments through my health fund.

5
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:16.400
Nothing helped me.

6
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:19.600
After a series of electromagnetic pulse treatments,

7
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:24.200
I stopped suffering. My back doesn't hurt anymore.

8
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.200
I have no pain at all.
